<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="TrustNova — AI-powered digital verification for images, videos, and audio." />
  <title>TrustNova — The Future of Digital Trust</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="TrustNova home">
      <span class="brand-mark"><span></span></span>
      <span>TrustNova</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#verify">Verify</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
    </nav>

    <a class="header-cta" href="#verify">Try verification <span>↗</span></a>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero section">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> AI-powered digital verification</div>
        <h1>Verify before<br><em>you trust.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          TrustNova is being built to help you assess potentially manipulated or
          AI-generated images, videos, and audio before you trust or share them.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#verify">Start verification <span>→</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note">
          <span class="tiny-shield">✦</span>
          Early-stage prototype · assessment, not a guarantee
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="orb orb-a"></div>
        <div class="orb orb-b"></div>
        <div class="hero-grid"></div>

        <div class="phone">
          <div class="phone-top"><span>9:41</span><span>◔ ◑ ▮</span></div>
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="feed-head">
              <span class="avatar">A</span>
              <span>Arjun's feed</span>
              <span class="more">•••</span>
            </div>
            <div class="post-media">
              <div class="fake-image">
                <div class="sun"></div>
                <div class="mountain m1"></div>
                <div class="mountain m2"></div>
                <div class="lake"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="scan-line"></div>
              <div class="ai-badge">AI signal scan</div>
            </div>
            <div class="post-meta">
              <div><span>♡</span><span>◌</span><span>⌁</span></div>
              <small>Viewed by 2.4K people</small>
            </div>
            <div class="verification-card">
              <div class="mini-label">TRUSTNOVA ASSESSMENT</div>
              <div class="assessment-row">
                <strong>Potentially synthetic</strong>
                <span class="confidence">78%</span>
              </div>
              <div class="meter"><span></span></div>
              <small>Review signals before sharing.</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-chip chip-top">
          <span class="chip-icon">◉</span>
          <div><small>Signal layer</small><strong>Image integrity</strong></div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-chip chip-bottom">
          <span class="chip-icon">✧</span>
          <div><small>TrustNova</small><strong>3 media types</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-strip">
      <span>BUILT FOR THE CONTENT YOU ACTUALLY CONSUME</span>
      <div class="type-pills">
        <span>IMAGE</span><span>VIDEO</span><span>AUDIO</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section problem" id="about">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">THE PROBLEM</div>
        <h2>When seeing isn't<br><em>always believing.</em></h2>
        <p>
          Synthetic media is becoming easier to create and harder to recognize.
          TrustNova is designed to give users another signal to consider before
          making a decision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-cards">
        <article class="info-card">
          <div class="card-icon">01</div>
          <h3>Looks real.</h3>
          <p>AI-generated images and edits can feel completely authentic at first glance.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <div class="card-icon">02</div>
          <h3>Spreads fast.</h3>
          <p>One uncertain post can travel through feeds, chats, and communities in seconds.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <div class="card-icon">03</div>
          <h3>Verify first.</h3>
          <p>TrustNova adds an AI-powered assessment to support a more informed choice.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section verifier" id="verify">
      <div class="section-heading centered">
        <div class="eyebrow">LIVE PROTOTYPE</div>
        <h2>Put a piece of content<br><em>under the lens.</em></h2>
        <p>Select a media type and simulate a TrustNova assessment.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="verifier-shell">
        <div class="media-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Media type">
          <button class="media-tab active" data-type="Image" type="button">Image</button>
          <button class="media-tab" data-type="Video" type="button">Video</button>
          <button class="media-tab" data-type="Audio" type="button">Audio</button>
        </div>

        <div class="drop-zone" id="dropZone">
          <input id="fileInput" type="file" hidden />
          <div class="drop-glow"></div>
          <div class="upload-icon">↑</div>
          <h3 id="uploadTitle">Upload an image</h3>
          <p id="uploadHint">Drop a file here or click to browse.</p>
          <button class="btn btn-primary upload-btn" id="browseBtn" type="button">Choose file</button>
          <span class="supported">Prototype simulation · no file leaves this page</span>
        </div>

        <div class="analysis-panel" id="analysisPanel" hidden>
          <div class="analysis-top">
            <div>
              <span class="mini-label">TRUSTNOVA ANALYSIS</span>
              <h3 id="analysisTitle">Analyzing image</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="status-pill" id="statusPill">Scanning</span>
          </div>

          <div class="analysis-visual">
            <div class="scan-ring"></div>
            <div class="scan-core"></div>
            <div class="data-node n1"></div>
            <div class="data-node n2"></div>
            <div class="data-node n3"></div>
            <div class="data-node n4"></div>
            <div class="analysis-text" id="analysisPercent">0%</div>
          </div>

          <div class="analysis-steps">
            <div class="step active"><span>01</span><div><strong>Signal extraction</strong><small>Patterns and structure</small></div><b>✓</b></div>
            <div class="step"><span>02</span><div><strong>Cross-check</strong><small>Content-level signals</small></div><b>✓</b></div>
            <div class="step"><span>03</span><div><strong>Assessment</strong><small>Risk interpretation</small></div><b>✓</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="result-panel" id="resultPanel" hidden>
          <div class="result-badge">VERIFICATION COMPLETE</div>
          <div class="result-main">
            <div>
              <span class="mini-label">AI ASSESSMENT</span>
              <h3>Potentially Synthetic Content Detected</h3>
              <p>This prototype identified signals that may indicate manipulation or synthetic generation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="score-ring">
              <span>78</span><small>/100</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="result-grid">
            <div><span>Media type</span><strong id="resultType">Image</strong></div>
            <div><span>Confidence signal</span><strong>Elevated</strong></div>
            <div><span>Action</span><strong>Review before sharing</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="result-foot">
            <span>TrustNova provides an assessment — not a guarantee of authenticity.</span>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="resetBtn" type="button">Run another check</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section how" id="how">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div>
        <h2>One simple loop:<br><em>verify, understand, decide.</em></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="steps-grid">
        <article class="how-step"><span>01</span><h3>Upload</h3><p>Choose an image, video, or audio file you want to assess.</p></article>
        <article class="how-step"><span>02</span><h3>Analyze</h3><p>TrustNova evaluates available content and signal patterns.</p></article>
        <article class="how-step"><span>03</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>See an assessment designed to be easy to interpret.</p></article>
        <article class="how-step"><span>04</span><h3>Decide</h3><p>Use the result as another input before you trust or share.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section closing">
      <div class="closing-card">
        <div class="closing-particles"></div>
        <div class="eyebrow">THE FUTURE OF DIGITAL TRUST</div>
        <h2>Don't just trust<br><em>what you see.</em></h2>
        <p>Build a better habit for the AI era: verify before you trust.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#verify">Try the prototype <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"><span></span></span><span>TrustNova</span></div>
    <span>AI-powered digital trust infrastructure · Early-stage prototype</span>
    <span>© <span id="year"></span> TrustNova</span>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
